*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Chocolate Doge]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

